<title>USA: Hughes DirecPC service in browser pacts.</title>
<headline>Hughes DirecPC service in browser pacts.</headline>
<dateline>GERMANTOWN, Md. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Network Systems said Thursday it was rolling out to consumers its satellite-based, high speed DirecPC Internet access service.</p>
<p>In a series of annoucements, the company said it had agreed to a series of licensing deals with leading Internet software and access providers to make the service easy to install and use by consumers.</p>
<p>The service also is avaiable at retail in CompUSA Inc superstores in California, it said.</p>
